Subject: [PATCH 1383/3799] soh: rename func_80AFF334 -> EnSkj_SetupLookAround

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: widens the engage cone and distance, arms the 400-frame battle exit timer and plays the look-left-right animation before installing SKJ_ACTION_RESET_FIGHT. Not named for that action because EnSkj_SetupResetFight already exists in this file and installs SKJ_ACTION_SARIA_SONG_IDLE instead.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c
